Meta.documentation:Boolean.not
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:Flips each Boolean passing through.
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:Streaming operator: true becomes false and false becomes true.
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@port in_Boolean_$all — each input Boolean
Meta.documentation:@port out_Boolean — the negated result
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@example
Meta.documentation:Boolean:true>>Boolean.not:>>Console:
Meta.documentation:---
Meta.documentation:false
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@see Boolean.and Boolean.or
